   "text": "The exchange morphism is [def-sfb-dc-open-base-change-morphism]. The isomorphism statement for\na cartesian square is [thm-sfb-dc-open-base-change-iso], and the inverse isomorphism is\n[def-sfb-dc-open-base-change-inverse].",
